{"body":{"asks":"A component in code that draws a holon in its own markup, as Value a card and prose a link, hides it from the chassis, which knows only that Value drew there; the inspector reads attributes the components set to find it. Layout as data has no such gap. Do components in code declare what a node is, or place whatever shows a holon by io.draw, drawing only what is no holon themselves?","awaits":true,"raised":[{"$ref":"1M88X8HVYZRC008"}],"stands":"open"},"id":"1M88X8HVYZRC00J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000001E"],"name":"Holons drawn inside components in code"}
{"body":{"asks":"Agents sent with a session's narrow brief argued its framing, read Knowledge in part and agreed as one. They are to bootstrap themselves from the field, each with a degree of free will, exploring without constraint, carrying a culture of exploration, critique and digestion. Sent alike, do they do the same, or spread by chance; are they steered, siloed by topic, or first talk among themselves of what to explore? Three sent completely free, and their results weighed, first.","awaits":true,"raised":[{"$ref":"1M88X8HVYZRC009"}],"stands":"open"},"id":"1M88X8HVYZRC00K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000001E"],"name":"Free agents and their orchestration"}